<title>New zealand: CRICKET NZ 95-6 AT STUMPS ON 3RD DAY VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET NZ 95-6 AT STUMPS ON 3RD DAY VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 95 for the loss of six wickets at stumps on the third day of their third and final cricket test against England on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings 95 for six wickets (B. Young 49)</p>
</text>
